	('dr-1783342962933', 'Rajabu Ibrahim kijida', '2026-07-06', 76, 65, '{"sections":{"punctuality":"Most students arrived on time with few latecomers","cleanliness":"School compound and classrooms are clean","academics":"All lessons conducted as per timetable","discipline":"Students were well disciplined throughout the day","breakfast_meal":"Breakfast and meals served on time, students satisfied","health":"No health issues reported","visitors":"No visitors today","special_events":"Examination in progress","security":"School security is good, no incidents","sports_games":"No sports activities today"},"attendance":[{"className":"Form I","regB":20,"regG":26,"presB":7,"presG":17,"sickB":0,"sickG":0,"permB":0,"permG":0,"absB":13,"absG":9},{"className":"Form II","regB":22,"regG":17,"presB":17,"presG":11,"sickB":0,"sickG":0,"permB":0,"permG":0,"absB":5,"absG":6},{"className":"Form III","regB":24,"regG":32,"presB":13,"presG":11,"sickB":0,"sickG":0,"permB":0,"permG":0,"absB":11,"absG":21}],"tod_comment":"Despite lower attendance of 53.9% today, the school day was conducted peacefully. We acknowledge the challenges and remain committed to working with parents and students to improve attendance. We are committed to improving punctuality in the coming days to ensure a better learning environment for all students. Every day is an opportunity to do better, and we will strive for improvement.","tod_name":"Rajabu Ibrahim kijida","headmaster_comment":"Attendance is critically low at 53.9%. Urgent action required to address absenteeism. 65 student(s) absent requires follow-up. Special events noted. The TOD report is acknowledged.","headmaster_name":"Saidi Rashid Mpambika"}', 'Despite lower attendance of 53.9% today, the school day was conducted peacefully. We acknowledge the challenges and remain committed to working with parents and students to improve attendance. We are committed to improving punctuality in the coming days to ensure a better learning environment for all students. Eve